        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Run **`python3 monitoring/budget/run.py run both`**. Only **budget-\u2026** stages appear in the Run selector and load-test charts, including warmup. Compare offered/accepted throughput, failures, dropped work and latency as the rate increases. Resource charts show both live deployments, including rollouts and restoration; they are not filtered by Run. CPU cost needs 30 seconds of continuous load. The runner\u2019s **report.html** records the configured budget, pass/fail gates and highest passing tested rate; this dashboard does not calculate those verdicts. Shared host databases and Java\u2019s host NATS are excluded. Run one benchmark at a time."
